/// ## The Region lattice within a given function
///
/// In general, the region lattice looks like
///
/// ```text
/// empty(Un) --------                      (smallest)
/// |                 \
/// ...                \
/// |                   \
/// empty(U1) --         \
/// |           \         placeholder(Un)
/// |            \                  |
/// empty(root)   placeholder(U1)   |
/// |                |              |
/// |                |              |
/// |                |              |
/// param regions    |              |
/// |                |              |
/// static ----------+-----...------+       (greatest)
/// ```
